    {
      "flavor_text": "かんそうした　とちで　くらす。\nあせの　かわりに　すなつぶを\nからだから　ぶんぴつする　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "건조한 땅에서 산다.\n땀 대신 모래알을\n몸에서 분비하는 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans des endroits arides. Il exsude du sable\ngranuleux au lieu de transpirer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in ausgetrockneten Gebieten. Statt zu\nschwitzen, sondert sein Körper Sand ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en zonas áridas. En lugar de sudar, su cuerpo\nexpulsa granos de arena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in territori aridi. Invece del sudore, espelle\ndal corpo sabbia granulosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives in arid places. Instead of perspiration,\nit expels grainy sand from its body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "乾燥した　土地で　暮らす。\n汗の　かわりに　砂粒を\n体から　分泌する　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en zonas áridas. En lugar de sudar, su cuerpo\nexpulsa granos de arena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんに　すなを　まとうことで\nばいきんから　からだを　まもる。\nみずに　ぬれることが　にがて。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전신에 모래를 둘러서\n세균으로부터 몸을 보호한다.\n물에 젖는 것을 싫어한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se recouvre de sable pour se protéger des\nmicrobes. Il n’aime pas l’eau.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es bedeckt sich mit Sand, um sich vor Keimen\nzu schützen. Es mag es gar nicht, wenn es nass wird.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se embadurna de arena para protegerse de los\ngérmenes. No le gusta mojarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si ricopre di sabbia per proteggersi dai germi.\nNon ama bagnarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from\ngerms. It does not enjoy getting wet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
